  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITR/T - International Telecommunication Union (ITU) - Partner to Connect</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau for Inclusive Growth, Partnerships, and Innovation (IPI)):  This project contribution will allow USAID to participate as a steering committee member in Partner2Connect, a multi-stakeholder coalition that focuses on fostering meaningful connectivity globally. It uses a coalition-based approach to engage stakeholders to mobilize and announce new resources, partnerships, and commitments to achieve universal and meaningful connectivity. The coalition aligns strongly with USAID&apos;s digital inclusion principles and leverages a variety of public and private stakeholders to work towards our goals. USAID conducted consultations for this activity with the Partner2Connect coalition members and with the ITU.</narrative>
  </description>
